{title: Only Jesus can satisfy your soul}
{subtitle: Hymnal 97}
{x_theme: heaven, joy, salvation}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/Only Jesus can satisfy you soul.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
Only Jesus can satisfy your soul
Only He can take your heart and make it whole
He’ll give you peace you never knew
Sweet love and joy, and Heaven too
Only Jesus can satisfy your soul

{comment: Verse 1}
The world will try to satisfy that longing in your soul,
You may search the wide world over, but you’ll be just as before.
You’ll never find true satisfaction until you’ve found the Lord,
For only Jesus can satisfy your soul.

{comment: Verse 2}
If you could have the fame and fortune, all the wealth you could obtain,
Yet you have not iwithin, your living here would be in vain,
There’ll come a time when death shall call you, riches cannon help you then,
So come to Jesus, for only He can satisfy your soul.
